# Guest-legal kernels and their vendored _hash.mjs must stay LF byte-exact so the
# OCG §17 guest ImageID / vendor-fresh sha (_hash.mjs body sha256 9d60ba8b) never
# drifts on a CRLF-autocrlf checkout. Pin all source + data to LF.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.mjs text eol=lf
*.js  text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.md  text eol=lf
